{
  "file_name": "f021.bf",
  "total_messages": 155,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "YES_NO",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yes.\nNo.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "HEAT_JOIN",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Heat joined the party.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "ICE_DONTHAVE",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> A blue wall stands in the way.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "ICE_DONTHAVE_Y",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> A yellow wall stands in the way.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "BLUEICE",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> A blue wall stands in the way\nto an extra area.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "ICE_BREAK",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Eliminate the wall?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Unknown objects have been\nappearing ever since the light\nflowed through the Junkyard.\nWhen you approach the objects,\nitems and equipment appear.\nIf you see one, you should\nprobably take advantage of this\nanomaly.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I have devoured several enemies,\nas commanded by law. Some went\ndown easier than others.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I came face to face with a rare\ndemon.\nIt was close, but I devoured it\nin the end. I gained a lot of\nMacca.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Have you recovered your memory,\nsir?\nDo you remember the Vendor?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yes, I am fine.\nPlease remind me.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_01_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Of course.\nThat is good to hear.\nRemember to stock up on items\nfrom the Vendor periodically.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_01_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Each time you defeat an enemy,\nMacca credits are recorded in\nyour Tag Ring.\nYou can exchange Macca for items\nand equipment at various Vendor\nlocations.\nThere's a Vendor in our base,\nas well. Why not pay it a visit?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "npc_05_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sir, are you aware that the Temple\nis looking for cells?\nYou can exchange cells for Macca\nat the Temple.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "offset": "npc_05_02_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I know.\nWhat is a cell?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "npc_05_02_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Of course.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "npc_05_02_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The Temple has not defined its\nproperties, but that information\nis not necessary for us.\nSimply exchange it for Macca at\nthe Vendor whenever you find it.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "offset": "npc_05_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sir, it seems that a fresh stock\nof ammunition is now available.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "offset": "npc_05_03_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I know.\nIs that right?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "offset": "npc_05_03_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Really?\nHow did you find out already?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "offset": "npc_05_03_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The regular bullets and explosives\nhave been replaced by anti-demon\nrounds.\nThey apparently have additional\neffects as well, such as fire,\nelectricity, and so on.\nStop by the Vendor and see\nfor yourself.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Do you remember everything now,\nsir?\nDo you want to know about\nthe Karma Terminals?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I already know.\nTell me about Large Terminals.\nTell me about Small Terminals.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_01_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I see. That's good to hear.\nIf you do not use Karma Terminals,\nit will be very difficult to reach\nNirvana.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_01_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You may teleport, recover, and save\nat Large Karma Terminals.\nIf you are defeated, your progress\nup to that point will be erased.\nMake sure to save and recover often.\nThere is a Large Terminal in our\nbase. Why don't you try it out?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_01_ans2",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Small Karma Terminals are just\nsimplified versions of the Large\nTerminals.\nSmall Terminals do not allow\nrecovery.\nSmall Terminals usually connect\nto a Large Terminal in the same\narea.\nThis base does not have a Small\nTerminal. There would be little\nuse for one here.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sir, a new option is available at\nthe Karma Terminals.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sir, there is a message from\nthe Temple.\nIt is an outline of the Mantra system.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_03_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I will skip it.\nPlease explain.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_03_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I see.\nIn any case, Mantras play an\nimportant role in battle.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_03_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Macca is required to gain Mantras.\nIf you want to strengthen your\nparty, then each member will need\ntheir own Mantra.\nAs you can see, you will need to\nearn a lot of Macca.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "offset": "npc_001_04_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What's the deal, boss?\nWhen I become a demon, I'm very\nstrong... but I can't deal with cold\nvery well.\nI hope nobody has attacks that\nfreeze the air or something.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "offset": "npc_001_04_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Do you know what fear is, sir?\nIt may be hard to believe, but\nsometimes enemies become afraid\nand lose their will to fight.\nDon't let them escape--devour them\nright away!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "offset": "sera_004_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It is the girl with black hair.\n> She seems to be asleep.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "offset": "heat_004_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "She knew what was happening\nall along?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "offset": "arujila_004_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "She is very mysterious.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "offset": "gale_004_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Her song seems to satisfy\nour hunger momentarily...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "offset": "ciero_004_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Do not worry about Sera.\nI will remain with her.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "offset": "sera_004_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> She is sleeping.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "offset": "sera_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'm sorry...\nI really don't remember anything...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "offset": "sera_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You seem to have a lot of friends,\nSerph.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "offset": "sera_03_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Friends?\nFriends... Maybe so...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "offset": "sera_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That's right, friends.\nIsn't everyone here your friend?\nFriends are more important than\nanything else. Life's empty\nwithout them.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "offset": "sera_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'm happy for you, Serph.\nAlways cherish your friends.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "offset": "sera_03_2",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I hope you continue to make\nfriends.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "offset": "heat_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Harley is still alive.\nHe was present when she appeared,\nso he may know details about\nthis girl.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "offset": "heat_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Harley is still alive.\nHe was present when she appeared,\nso he may know details about\nthis girl.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "offset": "heat_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera...\nHer name is... Sera.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "offset": "heat_05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Hold on, Sera.\nWe'll make sure you regain\nyour memories, too.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "offset": "heat_06",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Friends...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "offset": "heat_08",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "She knew what was happening\nall along?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "offset": "arujila_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I have not felt well since we\nreturned...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "offset": "arujila_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I do not feel well.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "offset": "arujila_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We'll die if we don't devour\nothers...?\nI just can't accept such a...\nterrible thing.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "offset": "arujila_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "They summoned every leader...?\nThat isn't normal.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "offset": "arujila_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I've made up my mind...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "offset": "arujila_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If I let myself die, then I'll never be\nnormal again.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "offset": "arujila_06a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Wait a minute, Gale.\nWe can trust Jinana.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "offset": "arujila_06b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We shouldn't fight if we don't\nreally need to...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "offset": "gale_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Do not concern yourself with the\ngirl. Our only concern should be\nreaching Nirvana.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "offset": "gale_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Do not concern yourself with the\ngirl. Our only concern should be\nreaching Nirvana.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "offset": "gale_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "...My mind feels odd.\nI do not... comprehend.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "offset": "gale_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Do not question orders from\nthe Temple. Serph, you must\ngo to the Temple.\nIt may shed light on who Sera is,\nor what is going on.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "offset": "gale_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Angel...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "offset": "gale_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The name sounds familiar, but it\nshould not... This is weighing\na great deal on my mind.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "offset": "gale_06a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I see. The negotiation was\nsuccessful, then.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "offset": "gale_06b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Remember that they will become\nour enemies eventually.\nAllow the Solids to weaken the Maribel\nif possible.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "offset": "gale_07",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Her song seems to calm our\nhunger temporarily.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "offset": "ciero_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I feel like I have met her before.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "offset": "ciero_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Argilla shares this sentiment.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "offset": "ciero_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Argilla and Gale are acting\nstrangely.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "offset": "ciero_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Is our leader all right?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "offset": "ciero_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "As long as the girl remains with\nus, we will not have to worry\nabout devouring our own Tribe.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "offset": "ciero_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If Sera had not been here,\nGale would have devoured me.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "offset": "ciero_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If doing this helps Sera too,\nthen I do not mind.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "offset": "ciero_06",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Do not worry, sir. No one knows\nabout Sera's location.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "offset": "sera_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
